values.content:
Condense this document into an executive summary.

Document type: {{ $json.documentType.replace(/_/g,' ') }}
Target length: {{ $json.targetLength.replace(/_/g,' ') }}
Audience: {{ $json.audience || 'general executive audience' }}
Focus areas: {{ $json.focusAreas.join(', ') || 'cover the document comprehensively' }}
Decision needed: {{ $json.decisionNeeded || 'not specified — informational summary' }}

Source document:
{{ $json.sourceDocument }}

Return JSON:
{"bottom_line":"1-2 sentences — the single most important takeaway, stated first","summary":"the executive summary body at the requested length — paraphrased in your own words, not lifted from source","key_findings":["specific findings or facts from the source, each as a standalone bullet"],"numbers_that_matter":[{"figure":"","context":""}],"uncertainties_or_caveats":["things the source document itself flags as uncertain, contested, or requiring further work"],"decision_recommendation":"if a decision was requested, a clear recommendation based on the source content — or null if purely informational","what_was_cut":"brief note on what level of detail was omitted for brevity, so the reader knows what to go back to the source for","read_time_saved_estimate":"e.g. reduces a 20-minute read to a 90-second read"}
